        "original_id": "120fc52f-4435-5a0e-9bf7-7a6cdefd9a22",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Cate Blanchett, Tom Tykwer, Giovanni Ribisi, Martin Scorsese, Katharine Hepburn\n- Films: Heaven, The Aviator\n- Events: 52nd Berlin International Film Festival\n- Topics: acting awards, film directing\n\nFacts:\n- Cate Blanchett was born on 14 May 1969 and is an Australian actress and theatre director.\n- Heaven is a 2002 romantic thriller film directed by Tom Tykwer and starring Cate Blanchett and Giovanni Ribisi.\n- The 52nd Berlin International Film Festival opened with Heaven by Tom Tykwer.\n- Cate Blanchett portrayed Katharine Hepburn in Martin Scorsese's 2004 film The Aviator.\n- Cate Blanchett's performance in The Aviator won her the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress and made her the only actor to win an Oscar for portraying another Oscar-winning actor.",
